{"headword":"פֶּ֫תַח","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.8\">Ez 8:8</a> (<strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.9\">2 S 17:9</a> but We reads <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחַד</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">אַחַת</span>, and so Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 86</sup>) opening, doorway, entrance;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:7\" href=\"/Genesis.4.7\">Gn 4:7</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּ֑תַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:11\" href=\"/Genesis.19.11\">19:11</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפֶּ֫תְחָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:6\" href=\"/Genesis.19.6\">6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּתַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:1\" href=\"/Genesis.18.1\">18:1</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתְחוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.19\">Pr 17:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתְחָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:38\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.38\">Ez 40:38</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּתָחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.5\">1 K 7:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.3\">Pr 8:3</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתְחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 24:7\" href=\"/Psalms.24.7\">ψ 24:7</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּתָחָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.34\">Pr 8:34</a>, etc.;—<em>doorway</em> of nomad’s tent, <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ הָאֹהֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:1\" href=\"/Genesis.18.1\">Gn 18:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:2\" href=\"/Genesis.18.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 18:10\" href=\"/Genesis.18.10\">10</a> (J); <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:8\" href=\"/Exodus.33.8\">Ex 33:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:10\" href=\"/Exodus.33.10\">10</a>(E); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:10\" href=\"/Numbers.11.10\">Nu 11:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:27\" href=\"/Numbers.16.27\">16:27</a> (JE); <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:20\" href=\"/Judges.4.20\">Ju 4:20</a>, cf. (without <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֹהֶל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:7\" href=\"/Genesis.4.7\">Gn 4:7</a> (in fig.), <a data-ref=\"Job 31:9\" href=\"/Job.31.9\">Jb 31:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 31:34\" href=\"/Job.31.34\">34</a>; of sacred tent, <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ הָאֹהֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:9\" href=\"/Exodus.33.9\">Ex 33:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:10\" href=\"/Exodus.33.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:36\" href=\"/Exodus.26.36\">26:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:37\" href=\"/Exodus.36.37\">36:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:38\" href=\"/Exodus.39.38\">39:38</a> (P); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 12:5\" href=\"/Numbers.12.5\">Nu 12:5</a> (E); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.15\">Dt 31:15</a>, usually (P) <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ אֹהֶל מוֹעֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:4\" href=\"/Exodus.29.4\">Ex 29:4</a> + 6 times Ex + <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:6\" href=\"/Exodus.40.6\">40:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:29\" href=\"/Exodus.40.29\">29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(פ׳ מִשְׁכַּן אֹהֶל מ׳)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.3\">Lv 1:3</a> + 22 times Lv, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:25\" href=\"/Numbers.3.25\">Nu 3:25</a> + 11 times Nu, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:51\" href=\"/Joshua.19.51\">Jos 19:51</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.22\">1 S 2:22</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.21\">1 Ch 9:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳ הַמִּשְׁכָּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:15\" href=\"/Exodus.35.15\">Ex 35:15</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:5\" href=\"/Exodus.40.5\">40:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 40:28\" href=\"/Exodus.40.28\">28</a> (all P); of court <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:26\" href=\"/Numbers.3.26\">Nu 3:26</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:26\" href=\"/Numbers.4.26\">4:26</a> and (of temple) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 8:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.8.7\">Ez 8:7</a>; <em>doorway</em> of (private) house <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:6\" href=\"/Genesis.19.6\">Gn 19:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:11\" href=